WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.013
Week 11: Food, Markets, and Restaurants. buy food order a meal handle dietary needs and problems

2
00:00:07.013 --> 00:00:14.324
Mission brief. Buy ingredients within a budget, order a meal, and resolve one incorrect item politely.

3
00:00:14.324 --> 00:00:23.942
Preparation. Select ten useful words, three linking expressions, and two repair phrases. Plan points rather than a memorized paragraph.

4
00:00:23.942 --> 00:00:31.957
Performance. Complete the task once for fluency, review the evidence, then repeat it for greater clarity and accuracy.

5
00:00:31.957 --> 00:00:40.698
After-action review. Record what succeeded, what blocked communication, and the single change that will matter most on the next attempt.

6
00:00:40.698 --> 00:01:06.849
Model language. Voy a comprar dentro de mi presupuesto. — I am going to buy within my budget. Pido una comida en el restaurante. — I order a meal at the restaurant. Recibo un plato equivocado. — I receive the wrong dish. Resuelvo el error con cortesía. — I resolve the mistake politely. Pido que corrijan mi pedido. — I ask them to correct my order.

7
00:01:06.849 --> 00:01:17.003
Check your readiness. Explain the core idea. Produce an original example. Complete the section assessment at 85% or higher.
